OL,3,AGirls to be given right to wear
OL,4,Atrousers in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome assembly members have now accused
OL,7,Fthe minister of making a "U-turn", with
OL,8,F"substantial sums of public money"
OL,9,Fspent on drafting legislation "to fix
OL,10,Fhis error of judgement".
